  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This serves 6 and takes about 1 hour 30 minutes from start to finish. The thing to watch is the final stage: once the rice has absorbed the sauce, reduce the heat to the lowest setting and let it steam for 10-15 minutes. This is when the signature smoky base layer forms."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Do not lift the lid during the final steaming stage. The steam inside is what cooks the top of the rice through. Every time you open the pot you lose heat and extend the cooking time."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
